request.description:
Returns last 6 months of business and payout totals for the trend chart.

.data shape (BusinessPayoutTrendResponse):
{
  "months": [
    { "year": 2026, "month": 4, "totalBusiness": 3200000, "totalPayout": 96000, "isPayoutZero": false },
    ...
    { "year": 2026, "month": 9, "totalBusiness": 5000000, "totalPayout": 150000, "isPayoutZero": false }
  ]
}

Edge cases:
- Fewer than 6 months of history: returns only available months.
- Month with no commission run: totalPayout=0, isPayoutZero=true (chart distinguishes from 'not yet calculated').

Approves a single pending business entry. The amount becomes eligible for that month's team business.

IMPORTANT: Approval is BLOCKED if the commission run for that month is already completed — response will carry errorCode=1 with the reason.

Response.data: { "message": "Business entry approved successfully." }

